      "title": "CJI Surya Kant declines to meet INDIA bloc leaders on October 12 ‘with reasons’",
      "link": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/cji-surya-kant-declines-to-meet-india-bloc-leaders-on-october-12-with-reasons/article71572588.ece",
